Almost all Space constructions require the same 19 ingredients, in various amounts. Both the amount of individual commodities and the super-majority (usually nearing 90%+) of the commodity tonnage comes from Refinery economies. You will need to source (or build a source of) these commodities, preferably in renewable sources in order to build your Primary Port and most of the space constructions.

This is only true for space: Surface constructions require a much wider variety of commodities, but will still require a super-majority of Refinery-economy commodities. The list of commodities you will need for Primary Ports are as follows (in varying quantities):



